<title>USA: Natural Alternatives names Spencer president.</title>
<headline>Natural Alternatives names Spencer president.</headline>
<dateline>SAN MARCOS, Calif. 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Natural Alternatives International Inc Wednesday named William Spencer, the company's executive vice president and chief operating officer, to the post of president.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said Spencer will continue as chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Natural Alternatives is a leading independent producer of vitamins, micronutrients, and nutritional supplements.</p>
